    /// <summary>
    /// The message that Amazon Lex V2 returns in the response can be either text or speech depending on the value of this parameter. o If the value is text/plain; charset=utf-8 , Amazon Lex V2 returns text in the response. Constraints: o min: 1 outfile (string) [required] Filename where the content will be saved
